Subject: [PATCH 35/73] Unified: names under the icons of the main toolbars,
 plain names for Boolean and Check Geometry

The toolbars with the main modelling flow show the command names under
the icons, like a ribbon. In Japanese, "Boolean" and "Check Geometry"
use everyday words, also in the error messages about Booleans.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
